{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/06/24/7451410/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/06/24/7451410/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"らじらー聞いてくださいましたか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/06/24/7451410/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"オリエンタルラジオさんが本当に面白くて素敵な方であっという間の時間でした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/06/24/7451410/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ファンの方と電話でお話し出来たのも嬉しかったです〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/06/24/7451410/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"仲良しの あみちゃんも一緒だったし"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"終始笑ってたなぁー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/06/24/7451410/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あの後お父さんからも連絡きて\nお母さんも「お父さん嬉しそうよ〜」って言ってた"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/06/24/7451410/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"父の日だったし大好きなお父さんのお話もできてよかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/06/24/7451410/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"共感してくれる方いないのかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お父さんがスポーツやお仕事頑張ってかいた汗の匂いが好きな娘さん息子さんとか"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/06/24/7451410/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/06/24/7451410/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"決していろんな人の汗とかの匂いが好きとかじゃないから！そんな変態ちゃんではないよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/06/24/7451410/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いい匂いの人がちゃんと好きだよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/06/24/7451410/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"パパは大好きだから許せるってこと"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/06/24/7451410/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/06/24/7451410/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日は幕張で個別握手会"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/06/24/7451410/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どんな服着ようかなぁ〜( › ·̮ ‹ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなはどんな服装が好き？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/06/24/7451410/0012.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"二期生"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/06/24/7451410/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"後輩だけど同級生"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/06/24/7451410/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやはやっぱりらんぜとあーちゃんは年下に思えちゃう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/06/24/7451410/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/06/24/7451410/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/06/24/7451410/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"らんぜはまあやの妹っていつも言ってる"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/06/24/7451410/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"会うたびに「まあやさぁ〜ん！天使〜」っていつも褒めてくれるのっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/06/24/7451410/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日も「よっ！」って言ったら「よっ」って言ってた"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/06/24/7451410/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あーちゃんもなんだかんだよく話すよね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/06/24/7451410/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"つまらない話をまあやがしても\nいつも沢山笑ってくれるの"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/06/24/7451410/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"赤ちゃんみたいでかわいいっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/06/24/7451410/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近沢山笑ってる顔見る"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/06/24/7451410/0017.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/06/24/7451410/0018.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/06/24/7451410/0019.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"舞台裏の早替え部屋"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/06/24/7451410/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"マネージャーが通る度にパシャパシャ撮って楽しそうに笑って一声かけて去って行くの"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/06/24/7451410/0020.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その時撮ってもらった写真"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/06/24/7451410/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前のめりになってて首が短く見える"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/06/24/7451410/0021.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/06/24/7451410/0022.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私の地元は地震や台風などの災害がほとんどない薔薇の綺麗な街です。\nでも今は豪雨で 広島は土砂崩れ、福山は冠水被害になっていて凄く心配です‥。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやのお家は大丈夫です。\n心配してくれてありがとうございます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなの住んでる所は大丈夫ですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"BYE"}],"source":"archive"}